--------------------------
 
(1 row)

SELECT (since(:'before') ->> 'relations_restored')::int > 0 AS restored,
	   (since(:'before') ->> 'apply_rows')::int AS applied,
	   d_digest() = :'at_y' AS at_y, clean();
 restored | applied | at_y | clean 
----------+---------+------+-------
 t        |   10000 | t    | t
